                  </h2>
                  <p> At Nekta, our operating philosophy is anchored in a set
                     of core pillars that define how we deliver consistent,
                     premium experiences at scale. These principles guide
                     every aspect of our operations&mdash;from kitchen to
                     service floor&mdash;ensuring reliability, innovation, and
                     impact across every touchpoint.</p>
